# impeccable is installed into ~/.claude/skills/ as its own ~413MB git clone,
# not as a fleet skill: it has no top-level SKILL.md and instead self-registers
# as the `impeccable@skills-dir` plugin (hence `impeccable:impeccable`).
# It is an external checkout, so it is not tracked here -- and a reconciliation
# reporting it as "only in global" is expected, not drift.
claude/skills/impeccable/

